      "title": "Philips remote (TP Vision)",
      "notes": "Philips TV remote; its buttons arrive via the Philips input devices TPV_MutilRC and TPV_SMTRC (microphone). The TV button (scan code 0x2ff) and the microphone (0xd9) both send keycode 811.",
